<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 78, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>账号与环境：两条安全的数据链路</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 16, padding: '5px 16px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>主讲 · A · 后端架构</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '18px 40px 10px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 3, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='key' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>账号安全链路</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>LoginInterceptor 全拦 /api/**、白名单放行登录注册与商城浏览；请求头名是 token；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>JwtUtil 用 validate(0) 强制校验有效期</span>（verify 只验签名）；密码 BCrypt 加盐哈希，库中无明文。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 2, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='question-circle' style={{ fill: '#FFC107', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>为什么</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8FA', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>token 是整个系统唯一凭证，验签不验期等于门锁没锁——过期 token 一律视为未登录。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 3, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='chart-line' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>环境数据链路</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>SensorSimTask 每 30 秒模拟温湿度 / AQI / CO₂ / 烟雾漂移；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>阈值判定只在后端</span>（烟雾 50 / 燃气 200 / CO₂ 1500 / AQI 150）；厨房 hasGas 特判，非厨房 gas 为 null；前端只展示、不上报。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 2, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>结果</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>采集与判定全在后端，App 只是"显示器"——直调接口也改不了环境数值。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智慧家居 App（仿米家）· 课程结项答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>10 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
